  "Kit batch kit-batch-8504-20261121 (2026-11-21), group 1 (Eastern docklands).",
  "Groups: 0 the west 38 m of the Veemkade street wall (w02-196 2024-10-16): seven bays of a grey fibre-cement panel storey with one wide three-light window per bay between two recessed balcony storeys with dark mesh balustrades and dark soffits, the thin grey fins at the bay joints left as wall between per-bay loggias; ground a tall glazed storey with red-brown timber frames under the cantilevered slab; 1 the east 22 m of the same wall (w03-196 2025-06-16), four bays, aligned with 0; 2 the 68 m quay wall (w01-16 2025-06-16, 42 % foliage): ribbed grey metal bands with ribbon windows on six upper storeys over the same glazed timber ground.",
  "Storeys read from the rectified crops: the glazed ground is about 7 m to the first slab (raised garden behind a mesh fence), upper storeys about 2.8 m.",
